  "description": "<p>Update the list of prefer headers to include all the current options:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers#RESTfulHTTPAPI-Containers-GETRetrievethecontentoftheresource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers#RESTfulHTTPAPI-Containers-GETRetrievethecontentoftheresource</a></p>\n\n<p>According to the specification, the following Prefer headers should be supported:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#PreferInboundReferences\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#PreferInboundReferences</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#PreferContainedDescriptions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/oa#PreferContainedDescriptions</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferContainment\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferContainment</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferMembership\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferMembership</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferMinimalContainer\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#PreferMinimalContainer</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
